r />💰冷氣清洗費</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;background-color:transparent\">:&nbsp;依房型收取</span><br /></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">🚫全面禁菸</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">🤗寵物可貓～須簽寵物條款</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">❄️獨立洗衣機<br />❄️有對外窗</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">❄️生活機能佳，附近有超商跟各式商店</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">🚌交通便利：<br />（1）</span>大橋頭站捷運站、民權西路站捷運站、圓山站捷運站、台北火車站。</p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">（2）</span>生活機能：近頂好、全聯超市、摩斯漢堡、麥當勞、肯德基（便利生活圈）。<br /></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">⭐⭐歡迎預約看房成交免服務費⭐⭐</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">🍀詢問詳情請加好友搜尋LINE&nbsp;ID@540jrooq</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">🍀電話(02)2550-3328</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">🍀可兩週內簽約起租再預約看房</span><br /></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">豐馥資產管理股份有限公司</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(108)北市租登字第0040號&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><br /></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、學校、夜市。\r\n本房屋近延三觀光夜市公車站、民權大龍街口公車站、大橋頭捷運站、台北火車站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "大同區延平北路三段", "lat": "25.0641631", "lng": "121.5112752", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "subway", "name": "大橋頭站", "distance": 264, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約264公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "延三觀光夜市站", "distance": 21, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約21公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "捷運大橋頭站", "distance": 224, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約224公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "美安SHOP.COM經銷商 民權西路", "distance": 917, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約917公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "黃家蚵仔煎", "distance": 3, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約3公尺"}]}, {"name": "